---
title: "withdrawRaisedCapital (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: projectAdmin invokes withdrawRaisedCapital()
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller is not projectAdmin
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_refund: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_refund --> q_revert_time: now < refundEndTime
    q_revert_time --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodActive
    q_check_refund --> q_check_supplied: now >= refundEndTime
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_supply: tokens not yet supplied
    q_revert_supply --> [*]: revert TokensNotSupplied
    q_check_supplied --> q_check_withdrawn: tokens supplied
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_revert_dup: capital already withdrawn
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert AlreadyWithdrawn
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_calc_fees: capital not yet withdrawn
    q_calc_fees --> q_transfer_fees: calculate Legion fee and referrer fees
    q_transfer_fees --> q_transfer_capital: transfer fees to Legion and referrers
    q_transfer_capital --> [*]: transfer remaining capital to projectAdmin; emit CapitalWithdrawn()

    note right of q_check_refund
        INV-001: Capital withdrawal only after refund period and token supply
        INV-002: Fees are distributed atomically with capital withdrawal
    end note
